<title>USA: Lilly Industries CFO Klusas resigns.</title>
<headline>Lilly Industries CFO Klusas resigns.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lilly Industries Inc said on Friday its chief financial officer Roman Klusas resigned for personal reasons.</p>
<p>A search will begin immediately for his successor, the company said.</p>
<p>--Reuters Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787.</p>
</text>
